{
  "id": "accounting",
  "inputs": "Versioned EconomicEvent, opening-state digest, authority/method/evidence/assumption versions, economic time, identity and cutoff; branch identity from history families.",
  "outputs": "TreatmentAssessment with eligible/unresolved/ineligible/outside_scope status; JournalProposal with typed lines and state delta only when eligible; StateTransitionReceipt with lineage, status and commit flag.",
  "invariants": "Eligibility separate from arithmetic; compatible context and source/method lineage; independent event/journal/state reconciliation; atomic journal/state/receipt requirement. Lookup key is entity/book/branch/business-event ID; event version and payload belong to the full request fingerprint. Exact replay returns immutable original receipt before freshness; changed fingerprint conflicts; only new identities face current-opening-state validation. These are specified requirements, not runtime guarantees. Binding supplement B1-B5 requires event/opening branch, event time, opening chart and method authority to equal the corresponding request references by immutable version.",
  "failure_behavior": "Return distinct MISSING_EVIDENCE, UNSUPPORTED_AUTHORITY, TREATMENT_UNRESOLVED, CONTEXT_MISMATCH, ROUNDING_MISMATCH, UNBALANCED_JOURNAL, EVENT_ID_CONFLICT and STALE_OPENING_STATE outcomes. Preserve known facts, rejection reason, submitted evidence and null state delta; retry only after receipt lookup. A binding mismatch rejects before identity lookup, eligibility or freshness, with null request/assessment/journal/delta/receipt, invalid structural status and no change to the four domain components.",
  "alternatives": "Direct balanced posting is a compact baseline but entangles eligibility and mutation. Event-sourced projection preserves history but needs typed treatment and projection timing. The proposed typed shared-IR adapter keeps the four stages and a single atomic receipt boundary.",
  "chosen_reason": "A typed shared-IR handoff preserves method/source identity and branch context while allowing independent eligibility, arithmetic, replay and atomicity checks. The choice remains provisional pending language/IR, persistence and interface contracts.",
  "interactions": "Consumes and preserves exact domain versions under architecture-integration-v1 and interfaces I1–I5; platform wrappers preserve native receipts, admission, joint dependencies and immutable views. P17 supplies source-grounded method implementations as specifications, without runtime execution.",
