  "id": "interfaces",
  "inputs": "Versioned OperationRequest and typed domain arguments, exact view/signature/profile locks, budget and expected head where applicable.",
  "outputs": "Typed OperationResult/native payload, coverage/unresolved regions, lineage, diagnostics and separate commit observation.",
  "invariants": "Extraction, review, history, uncertainty, accounting and reporting have separate effects; source and method admission cannot be inferred from type shape or arithmetic.",
